    "b-40-validation-context-loaders-report-27": {
      "id": "b-40-validation-context-loaders-report-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Keep static failures at the boot boundary instead of converting them into runtime warnings. Make the assembler's treatment of each loader status explicit. Test any path that must stop the run instead of rendering degraded context. The "
